    licence). ECMWF/Copernicus must be acknowledged for any use of ERA5.
The raw and assembled data cubes derived from these products are NOT
redistributed here; see data/README.md for acquisition instructions.

The trained model checkpoints in models/ are released under this same MIT
license as derived parameters; users remain responsible for complying with
the source-data providers' terms when re-deriving inputs.
